Create a premium futuristic “TECH UNIVERSE” visual for a GitHub developer portfolio.

Design a dark black/cosmic background with subtle stars, glowing particles, neon trails, floating technology icons, and elegant pink, purple, cyan, and magenta lighting.

At the center, create a glowing circular holographic core containing:

“JOSPHIN PRICILLA J”
“AI EXPLORER • JAVA DEVELOPER”
“FULL STACK BUILDER”

Surround the central core with multiple orbital rings, as if technologies are floating and orbiting around the developer.

Place realistic, recognizable technology icons around the orbiting rings:

Java, Python, C++, JavaScript, TypeScript,
React, HTML5, CSS3,
Spring Boot, Node.js, Express.js,
MySQL, MongoDB, SQLite, Firebase,
AWS, Docker, Git, GitHub.

Make the icons appear as individual floating holographic objects with glowing platforms underneath them. Give each icon subtle depth, reflections, neon glow, and a futuristic 3D appearance.

Add small moving-looking particles, glowing dots, tiny cubes, light trails, and orbital paths throughout the scene to create a sense of motion and energy.

At the bottom, include a sleek futuristic information panel divided into four sections:

AI / ML
• Machine Learning
• NLP
• Computer Vision
• AI Applications

Cloud & DevOps
• Cloud Computing
• Docker Containers
• CI/CD
• Deployment

