Make the composition wide and horizontal, suitable for a GitHub README.

IMPORTANT:
Do not use random technologies.
Do not add unrelated logos.
Keep all technology names and labels clearly readable.
Keep the central name highly visible.
Make the overall design sophisticated rather than overly flashy.
